  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="8">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIaAtr">VIIa Atr</ref> 8</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ æghwilce geare heonon forð gelæste man Godes gerihta huru rihtlice, wið ðam þe us God ælmihtig gemiltsige ⁊ us geunne þæt we ure fynd ofercuman motan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And every year henceforth the most scrupulous care shall be taken in the payment of God's dues, in order that God Almighty may have mercy upon us and grant us victory over our enemies.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
